[
  {
    "text": "一张十九路棋盘，有三百六十一个交叉点。",
    "startMs": 277.625,
    "endMs": 3775.25,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "hook"
  },
  {
    "text": "KataGo没有算完所有未来，",
    "startMs": 3775.25,
    "endMs": 6144.291,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "hook"
  },
  {
    "text": "为什么还能下出远超人类顶尖棋手的棋？",
    "startMs": 6144.291,
    "endMs": 8941.916,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "hook"
  },
  {
    "text": "它是大卫·吴发起的开源围棋引擎。",
    "startMs": 10410.958333333334,
    "endMs": 13920.458333333332,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "identity"
  },
  {
    "text": "核心可以拆成两部分：神经网络提供直觉，",
    "startMs": 13920.458333333332,
    "endMs": 17622.874333333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "identity"
  },
  {
    "text": "树搜索检验变化。",
    "startMs": 17622.874333333333,
    "endMs": 19587.124333333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "identity"
  },
  {
    "text": "两者配合，才决定下一手。",
    "startMs": 19587.124333333333,
    "endMs": 22039.499333333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "identity"
  },
  {
    "text": "先把局面交给网络。输入不只有黑白子，",
    "startMs": 23510.958333333336,
    "endMs": 27151.416333333334,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "input"
  },
  {
    "text": "还包括行棋历史、规则、贴目等信息。",
    "startMs": 27151.416333333334,
    "endMs": 30937.124333333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "input"
  },
  {
    "text": "同样的棋形，换了规则或贴目，判断也可能改变。",
    "startMs": 30937.124333333333,
    "endMs": 35270.45733333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "input"
  },
  {
    "text": "网络的策略输出，给合法落点分配不同的偏好。",
    "startMs": 36777.625,
    "endMs": 41346.666,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "policy"
  },
  {
    "text": "就像高手扫一眼，先挑出值得研究的几手。",
    "startMs": 41346.666,
    "endMs": 45108.583,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "policy"
  },
  {
    "text": "注意：偏好高，不代表这手已经被证明最好。",
    "startMs": 45108.583,
    "endMs": 49025.249,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "policy"
  },
  {
    "text": "另一组输出判断局面：谁更可能赢，预计领先多少，",
    "startMs": 50510.958333333336,
    "endMs": 54963.33333333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "value"
  },
  {
    "text": "各处最终可能归谁。",
    "startMs": 54963.33333333333,
    "endMs": 56901.41633333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "value"
  },
  {
    "text": "这些都是预测；中盘的归属图，不是已经围好的地盘。",
    "startMs": 56901.41633333333,
    "endMs": 61103.791333333334,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "value"
  },
  {
    "text": "接着进入蒙特卡洛树搜索。",
    "startMs": 62577.625,
    "endMs": 65039.541,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "tree"
  },
  {
    "text": "根节点是现在的局面，一条边是一手棋。",
    "startMs": 65039.541,
    "endMs": 68503.791,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "tree"
  },
  {
    "text": "往下一层，是对手的回应；",
    "startMs": 68503.791,
    "endMs": 70932.375,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "tree"
  },
  {
