    "startMs": 70932.375,
    "endMs": 73194.291,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "tree"
  },
  {
    "text": "搜索不会平均查看所有分支。",
    "startMs": 74677.62499999999,
    "endMs": 77425.25,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "selection"
  },
  {
    "text": "它既偏向目前评估好的选择，",
    "startMs": 77425.25,
    "endMs": 79746.666,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "selection"
  },
  {
    "text": "也给先验较高、但还没看够的选择探索机会。",
    "startMs": 79746.666,
    "endMs": 83568.083,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "selection"
  },
  {
    "text": "这是在利用经验和寻找意外之间取舍。",
    "startMs": 83568.083,
    "endMs": 86579.999,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "selection"
  },
  {
    "text": "走到尚未展开的局面，通常再请神经网络评估，",
    "startMs": 88077.625,
    "endMs": 91756.208,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "leaf"
  },
  {
    "text": "然后把结果沿路回传。",
    "startMs": 91756.208,
    "endMs": 93849.041,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "leaf"
  },
  {
    "text": "这里的模拟，不等于每次都随机下一整盘；",
    "startMs": 93849.041,
    "endMs": 97265.708,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "leaf"
  },
  {
    "text": "真到终局，才使用实际结果。",
    "startMs": 97265.708,
    "endMs": 99765.708,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "leaf"
  },
  {
    "text": "这样的选择、展开、评估、回传反复进行。",
    "startMs": 101277.625,
    "endMs": 106263.333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "update"
  },
  {
    "text": "某手一开始很受青睐，",
    "startMs": 106263.333,
    "endMs": 108227.625,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "update"
  },
  {
    "text": "深入后却可能暴露问题。搜索预算越充足，",
    "startMs": 108227.625,
    "endMs": 112489.541,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "update"
  },
  {
    "text": "通常越有机会纠正第一眼的判断。",
    "startMs": 112489.541,
    "endMs": 115239.541,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "update"
  },
  {
    "text": "最终选择综合搜索证据，",
    "startMs": 116744.29166666667,
    "endMs": 118851.41666666669,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "decision"
  },
  {
    "text": "也受具体配置影响。",
    "startMs": 118851.41666666669,
    "endMs": 120801.41666666669,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "decision"
  },
  {
    "text": "重点不是背住每条公式，",
    "startMs": 120801.41666666669,
    "endMs": 122968.08266666667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "decision"
  },
  {
    "text": "而是这条分工：网络缩小关注范围，",
    "startMs": 122968.08266666667,
    "endMs": 126146.66666666667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "decision"
  },
  {
    "text": "搜索把更多计算交给值得检验的变化。",
    "startMs": 126146.66666666667,
    "endMs": 129063.33266666667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "decision"
  },
  {
    "text": "那网络的直觉从哪来？",
    "startMs": 130544.29166666669,
    "endMs": 132601.4166666667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "training"
  },
  {
    "text": "KataGo的强化学习主线，",
    "startMs": 132601.4166666667,
    "endMs": 134553.7916666667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "training"
  },
  {
    "text": "靠自我对弈产生棋局。",
    "startMs": 134553.7916666667,
    "endMs": 136744.2916666667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "training"
  },
  {
    "text": "搜索给出更好的落子分布，",
    "startMs": 136744.2916666667,
    "endMs": 138863.33266666668,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "training"
  },
  {
    "text": "终局给出胜负和计分反馈，再用这些数据训练网络。",
    "startMs": 138863.33266666668,
    "endMs": 142946.6666666667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "training"
  },
  {
    "text": "更新后的网络再去下棋，",
    "startMs": 144444.2916666667,
    "endMs": 146765.70766666668,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "loop"
  },
  {
    "text": "形成循环。但你电脑上分析一盘棋时，",
    "startMs": 146765.70766666668,
    "endMs": 150251.4166666667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "loop"
  },
  {
    "text": "通常是在使用已经训练好的参数，",
    "startMs": 150251.4166666667,
    "endMs": 152549.0416666667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "loop"
  },
  {
    "text": "加上现场搜索；不是每落一子，都重新训练一次大脑。",
    "startMs": 152549.0416666667,
    "endMs": 156679.9996666667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "loop"
  },
  {
    "text": "KataGo的特色，也不只是会搜索。",
    "startMs": 158177.625,
    "endMs": 160949.04100000003,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "targets"
  },
  {
    "text": "作者特别改进了学习效率：",
    "startMs": 160949.04100000003,
    "endMs": 163187.125,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "targets"
  },
  {
    "text": "除了胜负，还学习目差和逐点归属。",
    "startMs": 163187.125,
    "endMs": 166710.958,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "targets"
  },
  {
    "text": "就像考试不只给总分，",
    "startMs": 166710.958,
    "endMs": 168615.708,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "targets"
  },
  {
    "text": "还让你看见分数来自哪里。",
    "startMs": 168615.708,
    "endMs": 170889.541,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "targets"
  },
  {
    "text": "一盘棋的输赢，反馈很粗。",
    "startMs": 172377.625,
    "endMs": 175172.875,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "ownership"
  },
  {
    "text": "哪些区域最后属于谁、最终差多少目，",
