    "endMs": 178458.583,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "ownership"
  },
  {
    "text": "提供了更细的监督信号。",
    "startMs": 178458.583,
    "endMs": 180613.333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "ownership"
  },
  {
    "text": "这些辅助目标，帮助同一个网络学出更有用的局面表示。",
    "startMs": 180613.333,
    "endMs": 185006.207,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "ownership"
  },
  {
    "text": "另一个办法，是在训练自我对弈时混合较浅和较深的搜索。",
    "startMs": 186510.9583333333,
    "endMs": 191818.08333333334,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "budget"
  },
  {
    "text": "浅搜索有利于更快产生更多完整棋局；",
    "startMs": 191818.08333333334,
    "endMs": 195103.79133333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "budget"
  },
  {
    "text": "较深搜索，提供更高质量的策略学习样本。",
    "startMs": 195103.79133333333,
    "endMs": 198389.5403333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "budget"
  },
  {
    "text": "它还用全局信息汇总，",
    "startMs": 199877.625,
    "endMs": 201746.666,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "global"
  },
  {
    "text": "让局部棋形的处理能参考整盘棋。",
    "startMs": 201746.666,
    "endMs": 205018.08299999998,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "global"
  },
  {
    "text": "这些设计一起服务于一个目标：",
    "startMs": 205018.08299999998,
    "endMs": 207303.791,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "global"
  },
  {
    "text": "把有限计算，变成更有效的学习，",
    "startMs": 207303.791,
    "endMs": 210065.708,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "global"
  },
  {
    "text": "而不是只把网络越堆越大。",
    "startMs": 210065.708,
    "endMs": 212030.0,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "global"
  },
  {
    "text": "看复盘界面时，要分清胜率和目差。",
    "startMs": 213477.625,
    "endMs": 217106.208,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "dashboard"
  },
  {
    "text": "胜率回答模型认为赢面怎样；",
    "startMs": 217106.208,
    "endMs": 219725.25,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "dashboard"
  },
  {
    "text": "目差回答预计领先多少。",
    "startMs": 219725.25,
    "endMs": 222249.041,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "dashboard"
  },
  {
    "text": "赢一目和赢十目都算赢，",
    "startMs": 222249.041,
    "endMs": 224272.875,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "dashboard"
  },
  {
    "text": "所以这两个数不能互相替代。",
    "startMs": 224272.875,
    "endMs": 226999.041,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "dashboard"
  },
  {
    "text": "九成胜率，也不是保证你接下来十盘能赢九盘。",
    "startMs": 228477.625,
    "endMs": 232832.37499999997,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "calibration"
  },
  {
    "text": "它依赖模型、搜索量和对后续行棋的判断，",
    "startMs": 232832.37499999997,
    "endMs": 236689.541,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "calibration"
  },
  {
    "text": "并不等于你这个棋手在实战中的兑现能力。",
    "startMs": 236689.541,
    "endMs": 239856.166,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "calibration"
  },
  {
    "text": "比较两次分析，先核对规则、贴目、模型和搜索预算。",
    "startMs": 241344.29166666666,
    "endMs": 246865.70766666668,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "rules"
  },
  {
    "text": "看似同一个局面，如果条件不同，数值就可能不同。",
    "startMs": 246865.70766666668,
    "endMs": 251508.58266666665,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "rules"
  },
  {
    "text": "发现推荐反常，先加算、看变化，再核对设置。",
    "startMs": 251508.58266666665,
    "endMs": 256103.79066666667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "rules"
  },
  {
    "text": "研究者也发现过，针对特定版本和设置构造的对抗棋形，",
    "startMs": 257610.9583333333,
    "endMs": 262765.7083333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "limits"
  },
  {
    "text": "能让很强的围棋人工智能犯错。",
    "startMs": 262765.7083333333,
    "endMs": 265834.74933333334,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "limits"
  },
  {
    "text": "这不抹掉它的棋力，但提醒我们：高水平表现，",
    "startMs": 265834.74933333334,
    "endMs": 269644.29133333336,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "limits"
  },
  {
    "text": "不等于对所有局面都可靠。",
    "startMs": 269644.29133333336,
    "endMs": 271715.7073333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "limits"
  },
  {
    "text": "所以，KataGo的强大，",
    "startMs": 273210.9583333333,
    "endMs": 275258.5833333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "payoff"
  },
  {
    "text": "不在于穷举所有未来。",
    "startMs": 275258.5833333333,
    "endMs": 277351.41633333336,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "payoff"
  },
  {
    "text": "而在于用学来的直觉指路，",
    "startMs": 277351.41633333336,
    "endMs": 279541.91633333336,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "payoff"
  },
  {
    "text": "用搜索检验，用自我对弈的反馈继续改进。",
    "startMs": 279541.91633333336,
    "endMs": 283244.29133333336,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "payoff"
  },
  {
    "text": "这才是它没算完，却依然很强的原因。",
    "startMs": 283244.29133333336,
    "endMs": 286399.04033333337,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "payoff"
  },
  {
    "text": "学棋时，别只记住它推荐哪一手。",
    "startMs": 287877.625,
    "endMs": 290875.25000000006,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "ending"
  },
  {
    "text": "更值得追问的是：这一手解决了什么问题？",
