    "endMs": 294220.458,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "ending"
  },
  {
    "text": "对手最强的回应又是什么？",
    "startMs": 294220.458,
    "endMs": 296780.00000000006,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "ending"
  },
  {
    "text": "让人工智能给出线索，也让自己学会检验。",
    "startMs": 296780.00000000006,
    "endMs": 300291.916,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null,
    "scene": "ending"
  }
